  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Esoteric Art — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>You  have learned the reversal of your technique that causes creative destruction  rather  than  creative  freedom.  As  an  action  for  2 CE you touch  a  non-magical  object  or  structure  within  5  ft,  spending  2  CE for every size category larger than medium it is. The target takes 50 necrotic damage + (25 for every additional CE). If this destroys the object or structure, it liquefies into black ink.</p>",
